{
  "id": "d49f33c1-9bbf-4e85-bc5b-64cfb4884037",
  "name": "第四章 夜縋而出",
  "fragments": [
    {
      "id": "6e852b21-60a0-48dc-aadf-f069d310cd58",
      "name": "main",
      "blocks": [
        {
          "id": "607ac506-177a-41f4-b8db-2eeffa1dcbf3",
          "type": "scene",
          "props": {
            "disabled": false,
            "sceneId": "d7489de1-2972-4543-9cec-5fcc8a38574b",
            "sceneName": "鄭國馬廄·夜",
            "uri": "",
            "transitionMode": "fade",
            "transitionDuration": "900",
            "waitForComplete": "false",
            "resetCamera": "false",
            "displayType": "cover",
            "position": "(50%,50%)",
            "anchor": "center",
            "size": ""
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "5a1f9c3a-74d9-4a02-8a0c-7e26c54cefe3",
          "type": "removeCharacter",
          "props": {
            "disabled": false,
            "characterId": "",
            "characterName": ""
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "34bd3bb8-5b7b-4bfb-88d4-106fd63cda14",
          "type": "sound",
          "props": {
            "disabled": false,
            "soundType": "BGM",
            "soundId": "bgm",
            "uri": "bgm/bgm_descent.mp3",
            "volume": "58",
            "loop": "true",
            "fadeDuration": ""
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "ebb069c4-1c5c-4c75-8d3f-9227e26ac281",
          "type": "narration",
          "props": {
            "disabled": false,
            "keepDialogue": true,
            "voiceHash": ""
          },
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "你換了一雙舊鞋。[wait=600]新的那雙是去年做的，鞋底硬，走在石頭上會響。",
              "styles": {}
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "46c9edfa-50c1-4d38-9429-1bd1ef636e0b",
          "type": "narration",
          "props": {
            "disabled": false,
            "keepDialogue": true,
            "voiceHash": ""
          },
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "你沒有帶任何東西。[wait=500]不帶符節——你不是使者，鄭國此刻派不出使者。不帶書信——寫下來的東西一旦被搜出來，就是罪證。[wait=700]你這一夜要帶去秦營的全部東西，都在你腦子裡：三十年的路程、關口、渡口，和一件晉國人早上渡河、晚上築牆的舊事。",
              "styles": {}
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "ce9487b6-2fd6-4499-af13-fa0224662454",
          "type": "narration",
          "props": {
            "disabled": false,
            "keepDialogue": true,
            "voiceHash": ""
          },
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "臨出門，你回頭看了一眼馬廄。[wait=600]十七匹馬在黑暗裡嚼草，聲音很整齊。牠們不知道今夜有什麼不一樣。[wait=500]——這樣很好。",
              "styles": {}
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "cfc47728-23c8-4ce2-a92a-0302a112c56f",
          "type": "callFragment",
          "props": {
            "disabled": false,
            "fragmentId": "d2f2a350-3215-402b-ac90-f506efae0cd5"
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "d2f2a350-3215-402b-ac90-f506efae0cd5",
      "name": "上城",
      "blocks": [
        {
          "id": "71fec18e-7a4e-4000-8806-0a2e9471e9ca",
          "type": "scene",
          "props": {
            "disabled": false,
            "sceneId": "d0b07818-d819-4ee2-a702-520131d6069d",
            "sceneName": "鄭國城牆·夜",
            "uri": "",
            "transitionMode": "cover",
            "transitionDuration": "1000",
            "waitForComplete": "false",
            "resetCamera": "false",
            "displayType": "cover",
            "position": "(50%,50%)",
            "anchor": "center",
            "size": ""
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "6317f223-d793-4118-aa87-cf16c2d85c71",
          "type": "removeCharacter",
          "props": {
            "disabled": false,
            "characterId": "",
            "characterName": ""
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "c25e3992-2c55-43f6-addb-748acfd8bc1c",
          "type": "narration",
          "props": {
            "disabled": false,
            "keepDialogue": true,
            "voiceHash": ""
          },
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "從馬廄到城牆，平常走要一刻。今夜你走了半刻——街上一個人也沒有，你不必讓路。",
              "styles": {}
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "9d84ebce-1afb-4626-81a0-cce57971d637",
          "type": "narration",
          "props": {
            "disabled": false,
            "keepDialogue": true,
            "voiceHash": ""
          },
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "城牆的台階很陡。你上到一半就得停下來喘。[wait=600]上面有人伸手來拉你，你搖了搖頭，自己扶著牆走完剩下的一半。[wait=500]你不知道為什麼要逞這個強。也許是因為，這是今夜你唯一還能自己決定的事。",
              "styles": {}
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "598393d3-35c3-4500-bb03-cb7b331d123c",
          "type": "narration",
          "props": {
            "disabled": false,
            "keepDialogue": true,
            "voiceHash": ""
          },
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "垛口邊上站著五六個人。佚之狐在，還有四個士兵，最年輕的那個看起來不到二十。[wait=600]他們都在看你。你能感覺到那些眼睛裡的東西——不是敬重，是那種看見一件事情實在太荒唐、荒唐到不知道該怎麼反應的表情。",
              "styles": {}
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "32000e46-85a8-47eb-a63b-587249c562ce",
          "type": "narration",
          "props": {
            "disabled": false,
            "keepDialogue": true,
            "voiceHash": ""
          },
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "你懂。[wait=500]換成你在城上，看著一個七十歲的養馬人要被繩子吊下去，去跟一個滅過十二個國家的君主說話——你也會是這個表情。",
              "styles": {}
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "099eb8dd-6a93-4d70-9617-7a75f090dea3",
          "type": "dialogue",
          "props": {
            "disabled": false,
            "characterId": "6ad98deb-8c22-49e4-b799-54365566b814",
            "characterName": "佚之狐",
            "expression": "憂色",
            "position": "center-left",
            "showCharacter": true,
            "keepCharacter": true,
            "keepDialogue": true,
            "isFirst": true,
            "isLast": true,
            "prevExpression": "",
            "voiceHash": ""
          },
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "「繩子我親自打的結。」[wait=600]他把繩頭遞過來，「活結，套在腋下。到了底下，把手臂一收就脫得開。」",
              "styles": {}
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "6624e888-f3ea-4b6a-bdca-f135258e927a",
          "type": "scene",
          "props": {
            "disabled": false,
            "sceneId": "ca35e8d6-d8b8-4601-a2ae-cea1119b21ba",
            "sceneName": "物·夜縋而出的繩子",
            "uri": "",
            "transitionMode": "fade",
            "transitionDuration": "600",
            "waitForComplete": "false",
            "resetCamera": "false",
            "displayType": "cover",
            "position": "(50%,50%)",
            "anchor": "center",
            "size": ""
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "4398e219-0a43-481c-84b7-ef7867487052",
          "type": "narration",
          "props": {
            "disabled": false,
            "keepDialogue": true,
            "voiceHash": ""
          },
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "你接過那條繩子。[wait=500]粗麻，新的，還帶著點刺手的毛。[wait=600]你這雙手握了五十年的韁繩、刷子、蹄鐵和藥碗，最後握住的是這個。",
              "styles": {}
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "e2dab6a2-82c3-48e4-bac7-db1c9214f181",
          "type": "scene",
          "props": {
            "disabled": false,
            "sceneId": "d0b07818-d819-4ee2-a702-520131d6069d",
            "sceneName": "鄭國城牆·夜",
            "uri": "",
            "transitionMode": "fade",
            "transitionDuration": "600",
            "waitForComplete": "false",
            "resetCamera": "false",
            "displayType": "cover",
            "position": "(50%,50%)",
            "anchor": "center",
            "size": ""
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "02249406-6387-4048-ac9b-ea7f68c0ad2e",
          "type": "narration",
          "props": {
            "disabled": false,
            "keepDialogue": true,
            "voiceHash": ""
          },
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "你把繩套從頭上套下去，往下拉到腋下。[wait=500]佚之狐替你收緊，收得很仔細，收完又試了兩次。他的手在抖。[wait=700]你反倒安慰起他來：「大夫，不會有事。」[wait=600]你自己也知道這句話沒有根據。",
              "styles": {}
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "948bce00-0d82-4f36-bf00-e4a994b734b4",
          "type": "narration",
          "props": {
            "disabled": false,
            "keepDialogue": true,
            "voiceHash": ""
          },
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "那個最年輕的士兵一直在看你。[wait=600]他手裡攥著繩子的另一頭，指節發白。你看他的臉——十八九歲，臉上還有沒退乾淨的孩子氣，可眼睛底下已經是青的。這五天他大概沒怎麼睡。",
              "styles": {}
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "aa82788c-462c-48d8-ae9f-03879502bb0f",
          "type": "narration",
          "props": {
            "disabled": false,
            "keepDialogue": true,
            "voiceHash": ""
          },
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "他忽然開口，聲音很小：[wait=500]「先生……」[wait=800]然後就沒有下文了。他不知道該說什麼。你們兩個素不相識，他今夜要做的事是把你放下去，而你今夜要做的事是走進敵營。這中間沒有什麼合適的話可說。",
              "styles": {}
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "ce862a3a-69c5-4083-a36b-010694d0efed",
          "type": "dialogue",
          "props": {
            "disabled": false,
            "characterId": "e0328378-2eea-4cd7-abf4-474cd3f4d7ff",
            "characterName": "燭之武",
            "expression": "蒼老",
            "position": "right",
            "showCharacter": true,
            "keepCharacter": true,
            "keepDialogue": true,
            "isFirst": true,
            "isLast": true,
            "prevExpression": "",
            "voiceHash": ""
          },
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "「繩子抓穩就好。」[wait=600]你說，「別的不用想。」",
              "styles": {}
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "f83d4f22-49f9-466c-8078-2473fb3959eb",
          "type": "narration",
          "props": {
            "disabled": false,
            "keepDialogue": true,
            "voiceHash": ""
          },
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "他用力點了點頭。[wait=500]你注意到他點頭的樣子——很用力，用力得過了頭，像是要把什麼東西按下去。[wait=700]你想起你三十歲的時候，也曾經這樣點過頭。",
              "styles": {}
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "ca16a660-5668-4875-8661-b431be7c8405",
          "type": "wait",
          "props": {
            "disabled": false,
            "duration": 700
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "07b39e08-6e79-4511-8d82-7b657bb2341a",
          "type": "narration",
          "props": {
            "disabled": false,
            "keepDialogue": true,
            "voiceHash": ""
          },
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "你回頭，最後看了一眼城裡。",
              "styles": {}
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "56c731d3-b2ed-4945-96dd-dfcc2e0d08b3",
          "type": "narration",
          "props": {
            "disabled": false,
            "keepDialogue": true,
            "voiceHash": ""
          },
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "沒有燈。[wait=600]整座城黑著，一盞燈也沒有點——不是睡了，是不敢點。五天了，城裡的人躲在黑暗裡，聽著自己的心跳，等一件他們阻止不了的事發生。[wait=800]七萬口人。你一個也不認識。",
              "styles": {}
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "d5e5bd1e-cf4c-414f-9b2c-59c1b0c04f5b",
          "type": "narration",
          "props": {
            "disabled": false,
            "keepDialogue": true,
            "voiceHash": ""
          },
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "其中有一個，昨天夜裡把自己和全家吊在了屋樑上。[wait=700]而你到現在還不知道他姓什麼。",
              "styles": {}
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "178b76c9-3080-4934-947a-f6d93a509844",
          "type": "narration",
          "props": {
            "disabled": false,
            "keepDialogue": true,
            "voiceHash": ""
          },
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "你轉回身，走到垛口邊上，往下看。",
              "styles": {}
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "ed41fa84-127f-43c5-aacb-2d93995991f2",
          "type": "narration",
          "props": {
            "disabled": false,
            "keepDialogue": true,
            "voiceHash": ""
          },
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "黑。[wait=800]什麼也看不見。",
              "styles": {}
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "fd24559b-cbc4-451f-8570-60165ec7e2cd",
          "type": "narration",
          "props": {
            "disabled": false,
            "keepDialogue": true,
            "voiceHash": ""
          },
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "你想起你跟國君說過的話——「夜裡看不清東西」。[wait=600]那不是推辭，那是真的。[wait=500]你這雙眼睛五年前開始壞，現在到了夜裡，三步以外就是一片糊。[wait=700]你腳下這座城牆有多高，你根本看不出來。",
              "styles": {}
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "71b984ef-9a98-402d-aa26-fb4c38cd1393",
          "type": "narration",
          "props": {
            "disabled": false,
            "keepDialogue": true,
            "voiceHash": ""
          },
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "可你也因此發現一件事，一件說出來會讓人覺得可笑的好事：[wait=700]看不見，就不怕。[wait=600]真正讓人腿軟的從來不是高，是「看見自己有多高」。[wait=500]你什麼也看不見。所以你只是站在一片黑的邊上，而不是站在一座城牆的邊上。",
              "styles": {}
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "6638ad3e-739c-48da-9add-7439db81b34c",
          "type": "dialogue",
          "props": {
            "disabled": false,
            "characterId": "e0328378-2eea-4cd7-abf4-474cd3f4d7ff",
            "characterName": "燭之武",
            "expression": "夜行",
            "position": "right",
            "showCharacter": true,
            "keepCharacter": true,
            "keepDialogue": true,
            "isFirst": true,
            "isLast": true,
            "prevExpression": "",
            "voiceHash": ""
          },
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "「放吧。」",
              "styles": {}
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "90dace4e-3cdf-4b18-9680-223780bbc888",
          "type": "callFragment",
          "props": {
            "disabled": false,
            "fragmentId": "d040bee1-8653-46a0-9611-55b6d0b5ed39"
          }
        }
      ]
    },
