        {
          "id": "c244bd7e-9fab-4e0e-b14b-e74a5d43dc05",
          "type": "narration",
          "props": {
            "disabled": false,
            "keepDialogue": true,
            "voiceHash": ""
          },
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "繩子繃緊的一瞬，你整個人被拎了起來，腋下一陣鈍痛。[wait=600]然後你離開了城牆。",
              "styles": {}
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "d7873a50-f09e-4d94-a59b-15fc98ea42fd",
          "type": "narration",
          "props": {
            "disabled": false,
            "keepDialogue": true,
            "voiceHash": ""
          },
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "他們放得很慢。一段，停；一段，停。[wait=500]每一次停頓，你就在半空裡晃一下，撞到牆面，又被彈開一點。[wait=700]你伸手去扶，摸到城磚——冰的，粗的，縫裡塞著幾十年的乾苔。",
              "styles": {}
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "3a18b74d-2a4f-40bb-aaf8-56bc29803fbf",
          "type": "narration",
          "props": {
            "disabled": false,
            "keepDialogue": true,
            "voiceHash": ""
          },
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "你開始數。[wait=600]數磚。",
              "styles": {}
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "bbb2f44f-50c0-49f3-89ae-28594538e8ed",
          "type": "narration",
          "props": {
            "disabled": false,
            "keepDialogue": true,
            "voiceHash": ""
          },
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "這是你一輩子的老毛病了。[wait=500]你在馬廄裡數馬的步子，數草料的捆數，數過路商旅說的日程；四十五歲那年你甚至數過名單上有幾個名字，數了三遍，每一遍你的名字都在第十一個。[wait=800]現在你在一條繩子上，離地不知道多高，眼睛看不見——[wait=600]你在數磚。",
              "styles": {}
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "e61ff927-f832-4276-a238-829e52d93d0d",
          "type": "narration",
          "props": {
            "disabled": false,
            "keepDialogue": true,
            "voiceHash": ""
          },
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "繩套勒在腋下，把你整個人的重量都掛在那兩道麻繩上。[wait=600]肋骨在響。你發現自己吸不了滿一口氣——繩子勒住了胸腔，你只能一小口一小口地換氣，像一條擱在岸上的魚。",
              "styles": {}
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "32b354ae-5808-466d-b35a-95f99001b543",
          "type": "narration",
          "props": {
            "disabled": false,
            "keepDialogue": true,
            "voiceHash": ""
          },
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "你這才明白為什麼佚之狐的手在抖。[wait=700]他打那個結的時候，大概已經想到了：一個七十歲的人，這樣吊十幾丈，光是勒，就可能勒死。[wait=500]可是沒有別的辦法。城門不能開。",
              "styles": {}
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "aec5944f-ef47-4c5e-b50b-f350db838e3c",
          "type": "wait",
          "props": {
            "disabled": false,
            "duration": 800
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "0bd9d7dd-b56a-4708-903c-ad50ea48536f",
          "type": "narration",
          "props": {
            "disabled": false,
            "keepDialogue": true,
            "voiceHash": ""
          },
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "十七。[wait=500]你的膝蓋撞上牆面，褲子破了，皮也蹭掉一塊。你沒有出聲。",
              "styles": {}
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "3afee9cb-854a-424c-9c12-3a34684d65ae",
          "type": "narration",
          "props": {
            "disabled": false,
            "keepDialogue": true,
            "voiceHash": ""
          },
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "二十六。[wait=500]上面的人換了手，繩子猛地滑了半尺。你的心跳了一下，但也只跳了一下——七十歲的心臟，連受驚都受得很淡。",
              "styles": {}
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "d98c127b-abf8-4c4f-873d-bfa75d0cd1cb",
          "type": "narration",
          "props": {
            "disabled": false,
            "keepDialogue": true,
            "voiceHash": ""
          },
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "三十四。[wait=600]風從城牆和你之間穿過去。你聽見很遠的地方有狗在叫，叫了兩聲就沒了。[wait=500]那是城外的狗。你已經在城外了。",
              "styles": {}
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "1a432be2-c390-4c99-8874-aacf6ff44805",
          "type": "wait",
          "props": {
            "disabled": false,
            "duration": 800
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "a725acd0-7844-48ae-bbde-686dbc344d31",
          "type": "narration",
          "props": {
            "disabled": false,
            "keepDialogue": true,
            "voiceHash": ""
          },
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "你忽然想起一件事：上面那幾個士兵放你下來的時候，好像沒有很吃力。[wait=700]——你比他們預想的輕。[wait=600]一個七十歲的人身上剩不下多少東西了，輕得像一捆柴。",
              "styles": {}
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "47e94f50-757b-4864-95da-f275361f5890",
          "type": "narration",
          "props": {
            "disabled": false,
            "keepDialogue": true,
            "voiceHash": ""
          },
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "這個念頭沒有讓你難過。[wait=500]你只是覺得，這樣也好。[wait=600]要是重一點，繩子斷了，這一夜就白費了。",
              "styles": {}
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "9fcc5026-f70a-4d5b-abca-6f3043f3911e",
          "type": "narration",
          "props": {
            "disabled": false,
            "keepDialogue": true,
            "voiceHash": ""
          },
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "四十一。[wait=800]四十二。[wait=1000]",
              "styles": {}
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "285c09a2-89ad-4c7a-b651-9f6c415e82d2",
          "type": "narration",
          "props": {
            "disabled": false,
            "keepDialogue": true,
            "voiceHash": ""
          },
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "腳觸到了地。",
              "styles": {}
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "a81b8aba-37f0-4cfb-b524-dff2893b4b45",
          "type": "callFragment",
          "props": {
            "disabled": false,
            "fragmentId": "995f2a68-7896-4e67-aa38-96146bd52828"
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "995f2a68-7896-4e67-aa38-96146bd52828",
      "name": "落地",
      "blocks": [
        {
          "id": "a9108046-2a25-462c-a1da-7d4488a4fae1",
          "type": "scene",
          "props": {
            "disabled": false,
            "sceneId": "d0b07818-d819-4ee2-a702-520131d6069d",
            "sceneName": "鄭國城牆·夜",
            "uri": "",
            "transitionMode": "fade",
            "transitionDuration": "700",
            "waitForComplete": "false",
            "resetCamera": "false",
            "displayType": "cover",
            "position": "(50%,50%)",
            "anchor": "center",
            "size": ""
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "1eb8cf7a-0bf6-446e-b3c1-119888b30011",
          "type": "removeCharacter",
          "props": {
            "disabled": false,
            "characterId": "",
            "characterName": ""
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "5a4710a3-8373-40c7-a882-1698d88df4e6",
          "type": "stopSound",
          "props": {
            "disabled": false,
            "soundType": "SE",
            "soundId": "",
            "fadeDuration": "900"
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "8488390b-6b56-404c-a80a-b7e7b6e3a70f",
          "type": "resetCamera",
          "props": {
            "disabled": false
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "f1a7db20-67bd-4681-ac6d-0a7c5ede88e2",
          "type": "narration",
          "props": {
            "disabled": false,
            "keepDialogue": true,
            "voiceHash": ""
          },
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "你站在土上，站了好一會兒才敢把重量交給自己的腿。[wait=600]兩條腿都在抖，抖得不聽話。你扶著牆，等它們停下來。",
              "styles": {}
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "71e5a57e-c989-473e-9ddf-d4d6c5c0db66",
          "type": "narration",
          "props": {
            "disabled": false,
            "keepDialogue": true,
            "voiceHash": ""
          },
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "然後你把手臂一收，繩套鬆了，從你身上滑下去。[wait=500]你把它扔開。",
              "styles": {}
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "efabdbf4-d416-4a3d-b4b4-86088fe73d97",
          "type": "narration",
          "props": {
            "disabled": false,
            "keepDialogue": true,
            "voiceHash": ""
          },
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "繩子往上收了。[wait=700]你聽見它擦過城磚的聲音，一下一下，越來越高，越來越輕，最後聽不見了。",
              "styles": {}
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "19268f5e-eb4e-438c-8996-ab300f1b5b57",
          "type": "narration",
          "props": {
            "disabled": false,
            "keepDialogue": true,
            "voiceHash": ""
          },
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "你伸出手，想抓一下。[wait=800]抓了個空。[wait=600]那本來就不是為了讓你回去用的——一條垂在城牆外面的繩子，天亮以後會被人看見。它必須收上去。",
              "styles": {}
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "a1df6df0-b648-4e94-9f78-2ee8acbff8f7",
          "type": "narration",
          "props": {
            "disabled": false,
            "keepDialogue": true,
            "voiceHash": ""
          },
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "你抬起頭，往上望。[wait=600]眼睛看不清，可你隱約覺得，垛口那裡有一個很小的、圓圓的黑影，一動不動。[wait=700]——大概是那個年輕的士兵，還趴在上面看。",
              "styles": {}
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "2d77280a-10b2-4ee7-b8bf-96d419dcf000",
          "type": "narration",
          "props": {
            "disabled": false,
            "keepDialogue": true,
            "voiceHash": ""
          },
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "你朝那個方向擺了擺手。[wait=500]你不知道他看不看得見；這麼黑，多半是看不見的。[wait=600]可你還是擺了。[wait=800]你這一輩子沒有人送過行。今夜有一個十八歲的孩子趴在城頭上看你走——這樣就夠了，夠得有點多。",
              "styles": {}
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "a8d91ac1-4935-441b-84b9-8f58e73a354a",
          "type": "narration",
          "props": {
            "disabled": false,
            "keepDialogue": true,
            "voiceHash": ""
          },
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "你收回手，看著那堵牆。[wait=500]城牆在你上面，黑黑的一堵，什麼細節都沒有。[wait=600]你看了它七十年，從裡面看了七十年——原來從外面看，它是這個樣子的。",
              "styles": {}
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "ee792cef-210f-47ab-9918-61abe227a087",
          "type": "narration",
          "props": {
            "disabled": false,
            "keepDialogue": true,
            "voiceHash": ""
          },
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "它不像在保護誰。[wait=700]它就只是一堵牆，很高，很硬，把裡面的七萬口人和外面的兩支軍隊隔開。[wait=500]而你現在在外面。",
              "styles": {}
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "09391bb4-9c7f-4f3f-ba65-6bab1c0798dc",
          "type": "callFragment",
          "props": {
            "disabled": false,
            "fragmentId": "0fcbe843-9367-438e-b105-47272f17ed50"
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "0fcbe843-9367-438e-b105-47272f17ed50",
      "name": "章末·走",
      "blocks": [
        {
          "id": "3c7352c2-1a12-4f03-8ac6-ab2cbc67ad65",
          "type": "narration",
          "props": {
            "disabled": false,
            "keepDialogue": true,
            "voiceHash": ""
          },
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "你在牆根下站著，理了理衣服。[wait=500]膝蓋那塊皮在火辣辣地疼，你彎腰摸了一下，手上有血。[wait=600]你把手在褲子上擦乾淨。",
              "styles": {}
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "2e418291-f2e7-4684-8bd6-c47f213476b5",
          "type": "narration",
          "props": {
            "disabled": false,
            "keepDialogue": true,
            "voiceHash": ""
          },
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "一個念頭很清楚地浮上來：[wait=700]你上不去了。",
              "styles": {}
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "ea68ec85-71ea-4731-b507-f6846828d472",
          "type": "narration",
          "props": {
            "disabled": false,
            "keepDialogue": true,
            "voiceHash": ""
          },
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "不是說沒有人會再放繩子——是說，這件事到這裡就沒有回頭的餘地了。[wait=600]你不能敲城門說我改主意了。你不能在牆根下坐到天亮。[wait=500]你只剩下一個方向可以走。",
              "styles": {}
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "6e7b5ed8-cfcb-4612-ac70-e817699805af",
          "type": "narration",
          "props": {
            "disabled": false,
            "keepDialogue": true,
            "voiceHash": ""
          },
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "你七十年來做過的每一個決定，都是可以反悔的。[wait=600]守不守那場喪、[wait=250] 燒不燒那卷策論、[wait=250] 記不記那些諸侯的事、[wait=250] 雨天出不出去換那副蹄鐵[wait=500] ——這些事做了或沒做，第二天太陽照樣出來，日子照樣過。[wait=800]今夜這一件不是。[wait=600]今夜這一件，繩子已經收上去了。",
              "styles": {}
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "3c8b0e0c-a908-4d33-b4a0-c9d5757d94ee",
          "type": "narration",
          "props": {
            "disabled": false,
            "keepDialogue": true,
            "voiceHash": ""
          },
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "你朝南邊轉過身。[wait=500]氾南在那個方向，秦軍在那裡。三十里外的函陵是晉軍，不能去；你這一夜只能見秦君，因為秦晉沒有駐在一起——這是鄭國最後的運氣，也是佚之狐在城上反覆交代的那一句。",
              "styles": {}
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "5c9de7f4-a676-4aa2-a475-cbd4a839a293",
          "type": "narration",
          "props": {
            "disabled": false,
            "keepDialogue": true,
            "voiceHash": ""
          },
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "你看不見路。[wait=600]你就順著風走。風是從南邊來的，帶著一點很淡的、燒柴的味道——那是幾萬人的營火，燒了五天。",
              "styles": {}
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "cd91d709-57f9-4624-bea2-c7487225ace4",
          "type": "narration",
          "props": {
            "disabled": false,
            "keepDialogue": true,
            "voiceHash": ""
          },
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "你邁出第一步。[wait=800]然後是第二步。",
              "styles": {}
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "168bbf70-67f3-45df-b2e0-0939da7ccfa6",
          "type": "narration",
          "props": {
            "disabled": false,
            "keepDialogue": true,
            "voiceHash": ""
          },
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "七十年。[wait=600]你這一生走過的所有路，都是別人讓你走的：讓你去馬廄，讓你留在馬廄，讓你在馬廄裡待四十年。[wait=900]只有這一段路，是你自己要走的。",
              "styles": {}
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
}
